ould not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'Dem rebuild di merged index for \'%s\', but di translation index no fit record am; di next rebuild go try again.','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'Dem go give di original text and di translations wey dem make from am to other sites wey install di same version.','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'The package no list any main translation file.','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Di package no get %s for im own text domain.','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Di package manifest kind \'%1$s\' no match di kind wey dem request \'%2$s\'.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'The package no produce any main translation file wey dem fit serve.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Di package text domain \'%1$s\' no match dis site copy of di component (\'%2$s\'), so dem no install am.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'We no fit read di packaged component.','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'The registration challenge no dey for di form wey we expect.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Dem no fit send di report.','The search could not be completed.'=>'Di search no complete.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Di service tell dis site make e wait before e sync again.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Di service no fit reach your site. Maybe firewall, security plugin or host rule dey block di request; abeg allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Di upload offer from di service no complete.',