dle at most %4$d for each run. Reduce di managed languages for Settings or deactivate plugins and themes wey you no dey use, then press Check again now.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Dis site no get purchase wey we fit show code for.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'This site don already get license. Reload the page.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'This site neva register with Babilim yet.','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Dis site pass di size wey di service dey accept for one sync, so dem leave some items out: %1$d component dem and %2$d locale dem.','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'This site dey part of multisite network, wey no dey install new translations automatically. Translations wey dem don already install go still update.','This site is verified.'=>'Dem don verify dis site.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Dem must verify dis site first.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'Dis site URL, so di service fit confirm say na you get am.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Dis site address too long for Babilim to register.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Di locale wey dem set for dis site.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Dis site locale code no be one wey Babilim fit register.','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Dem no fit report dis string from dis site.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Dis string no dey among di translation dem wey don install for dis site. Search again and pick am from di list.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'D