 %1$d of %2$d…','Uploading…'=>'Dey upload…','Verified'=>'Dem don verify am','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Di verify response no get site_token.','Version %s'=>'Version %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Wetin dem dey send when you turn on Babilim','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'When something fail inside Babilim, send error report go di Babilim service so dem fit make am published as public issue for GitHub. Dem go send di report as if e come from dis site, with di same authentication as every other request to di Babilim service. Di service go show only di error code and versions as published public issue for GitHub; di public issue no get site address, content or file paths. E dey off by default.','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Where you see dis (optional)','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'As this one dey on, translations wey di service list as available for di languages wey you dey manage go install during di sync wey dey happen two times every day.','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'Wrong for dis context','Wrong meaning'=>'Wrong meaning','Wrong plural form'=>'Wrong plural form','Wrong term'=>'Wrong term','Yes'=>'Yes','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Dem no allow you do dis one.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'Your PHP version, for compatibility.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Your WordPress version, so we fit give translation files wey go work with am.','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Your new restore code: %s. Keep am for safe place — di old code no dey work again.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'AI models dey process your report automatically, and e fit make dis translation better for other sites.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Your site answer, but no be wetin dem expect. Another plugin fit don rewrite di REST API, or dem fit don cache dat endpoint; abeg exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Your site take too long to answer. Abeg try again later, and check say your host no too slow or overload.','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip no get manifest.json.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip no get default file wey suppose dey: %s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip no get file wey suppose dey: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json get structure wey nobody expect','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'we no fit read _manifest.json: %s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest no dey or e get invalid \'%s\'.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest \'server_build_id\' no be valid build id.','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'We no fit parse _manifest.json: %s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'e go orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (pass half)','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'e go orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json get invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json get invalid \'default_domain_files\'.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'manifest.json for inside di zip no be valid JSON.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json no dey or e get invalid \'%s\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json no dey or e get invalid \'build_no\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json no dey or e get invalid \'entries\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json no dey or e get invalid \'extra_domains\'.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json no dey or e get invalid \'files\'.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json \'%s\' no match di value wey dem expect.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json \'contract\' no be valid version string.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json \'server_build_id\' no be valid build id.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json \'status\' must be \'published\'.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce must be hexadecimal string.','per day'=>'per day','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'sha256 mismatch for %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'sha256 mismatch for default/%s','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plugin','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'theme','problem report categoryOther'=>'Other','translation statusAvailable'=>'E dey available','translation statusInstalled'=>'Don install','Babilim translation turned off.'=>'Babilim translation don turn off.','Stop using Babilim translation'=>'Stop dey use Babilim translation','Use Babilim translation'=>'Use Babilim translation','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the theme\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'You wan stop to use Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress go use di theme own translation or WordPress.org translation instead. You fit switch back anytime.','Stop using the Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress will use the plugin\'s own or WordPress.org translation instead. You can switch back at any time.'=>'You wan stop to use Babilim translation of %1$s (%2$s)? WordPress go use di plugin own translation or WordPress.org translation instead. You fit switch back anytime.','Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes'=>'Babilim – Auto-Translate Plugins & Themes','Enjoying Babilim? Please leave a rating on WordPress.org.'=>'You dey enjoy Babilim? Abeg leave rating for WordPress.org.','Rate Babilim'=>'Rate Babilim','Babilim translation bundled with the theme'=>'Babilim translation wey dey inside di theme','Babilim translation bundled with the plugin'=>'Babilim translation wey dey inside di plugin','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, the languages it already includes, and which of those bundled translations Babilim generated (language codes only). For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'For every plugin and theme wey dem don install: im name (slug), version, text domain, whether dem list am for WordPress.org, di languages wey e don already include, and which one for those bundled translations na Babilim generate (language codes only). For each Babilim translation wey you don install: which version e be, when dem last check am, and whether e pass im file check.']];